OL,3,AJensen Huang pushes Nvidia comeback
OL,4,Aafter board rejects pressure to
OL,5,Areinstate ex-boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang said he would be
OL,8,F"honoured" to return as the boss of
OL,9,Ftech giant Nvidia, in his first public
OL,10,Fcomments since his shock resignation.
OL,12,F"I have made serious mistakes in my
OL,13,Fpersonal life. I created problems for
OL,14,Fthe Board that I deeply regret. I own
OL,15,Fmy mistakes completely," Huang said on
OL,16,FX, days after reports he had
OL,17,Fextramarital affairs, including with an
OL,18,Falleged Chinese spy.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
