OL,3,AJensen Huang pushes Nvidia comeback
OL,4,Aafter board rejects pressure to
OL,5,Areinstate ex-boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut he said he had an "outpouring" of
OL,8,Fcalls from company employees, investors
OL,9,Fand others calling for him to return as
OL,10,FCEO of Nvidia.
OL,12,FAs the BBC reported on Monday, Nvidia's
OL,13,Fboard is not considering bringing him
OL,14,Fback to lead the company.
